The Devolo DLAN pro 1200+ WiFi ac is hardware-wise the same as the DLAN 1200+ WiFi ac (non-pro) variant.
The openwrt firmware includes pro in the device name, though it can be flashed on the non-pro version as well.

The DLAN pro 1200+ WiFi ac is a wall-plug device which still exposes the plug.
It has Powerline capabilities, which are only useful if the proprietary firmware is added.
Other than that, it includes 2 LAN ports and 2.4GHz as well as 5GHz wifi.

